    ],
    "why": "NOT EQUIVALENT, and it was recorded as though it were. The escape assigns the plan WHOLESALE (`this.deltas = plan`) and sets `purse = fullPurse - cost`, so re-planning against the REMAINING purse over the live deltas leaves the purse non-zero, `confirm` refuses, and the window never closes - the host drops it anyway and the level-up is lost with everything already spent. The first record called that an equivalence because no pin drove the escape from a PARTLY SPENT window; one does now (ORL1's deep audit)."
